    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799110/extras/3b4f3b7ce800dfbd68807e4d84c85bbf.avif?t=1711041590\" width=616 height=616 /></span><br>QUICKERFLAK 2 is a retro-hardcore room-beater time-attack super-fast-paced minigame that challenges you to move as fast as you can to the last room, mixing quick shooting, melee, and geometric perception.<br>Each room is guarded by intelligent enemies, calling for different approaches and nimble reactions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799110/extras/b0df85eb4b72ef358c1b8d644ca91a28.avif?t=1711041590\" width=616 height=418 /></span><br>With organic aesthetics, awesome music, and hard-boiled gameplay handcrafted by Walter Machado, QUICKERFLAK 2 maxed out the original QUICKERFLAK formula, adding melee and boosted versions of the classic enemies.<br>Welcome back to QUICKERFLAK!",
